00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:42.000
I think that's fair to say. And the Austrians are the worst for this. Anyway, so the French cabinet is meeting that morning and deciding on mobilisation. Still, in Britain, the sense is we will stay out. There's only really one newspaper that has been really keen on getting involved, and that's always been the Times. Your paper. Always a very anti-German paper. Most of the papers are still at this point. Don't forget, Britain is only three days away from joining the
我认为这样说是公平的。奥地利人在这方面是最糟糕的。总之，法国内阁那天早上开会决定动员。在英国，人们的感觉仍然是我们会置身事外。只有一份报纸一直非常热衷于参与，那就是《泰晤士报》。你的报纸。一直是一份非常反德的报纸。大多数报纸此时仍然如此。别忘了，英国距离加入战争只有三天了。

