没有足够的资本支持。完全正确。现在，如果那是一个感人的场景，今天这个8月1日星期六还有两个绝对非凡的感人场景。第一个是在圣彼得堡。下午7点整，汤姆，你提到的那位大使，波塔莱斯伯爵，被准许进入俄国外交部，外交部长谢尔盖·萨佐诺夫正在等他。波塔莱斯对他说了三次：“你会停止你的军事措施吗？”萨佐诺夫说：“不，不，niet，或者可能是non。”他们实际上可能在说法语。他说：“non, non, non。”波塔莱斯非常感动。他有点颤抖。他呼吸沉重。

38
00:18:42.000 --> 00:19:28.000
And he says, in that case, Monsieur le Ministre, I am commanded to give you this note. And the note is the declaration of war. And at that point, Portales totally loses it, breaks down in tears, puts his hand to his head and says, I never would have believed that I would leave St. Petersburg under circumstances like this. I can't believe it. And he's crying. And incredibly, Sazonov starts crying as well and says to him in French, believe me, monsieur, one day we will meet again. And they embraced each other before Portales went out of the room. Quite a contrast to how Germany will declare war on Russia later in the century.
