He goes down the main, the Great Avenue, Unter den Linden in Berlin, and he's dressed up. He loves, we know the Kaiser loves to dress up. It's pretty clear from all the sources you've been citing that he didn't actually want to go to war. No. He shrunk from it. But now the bullet has been bitten. I mean, this is kind of what he's made for, isn't it? Yeah.
