I no longer see political parties, I see only Germans. All that matters now is that we stand together like brothers and God will help the German sword to victory. This is the part for which he's been rehearsing all his life. It is. And actually, do you know who he reminds me of at this point? Somebody else who rehearsed for this role all his life, Churchill. Churchill.
“我不再看到政党，我只看到德国人。”现在唯一重要的是我们像兄弟一样站在一起，上帝会帮助德国之剑取得胜利。这是他一生都在排练的角色。是的。而且，你知道他此时让我想起了谁吗？另一个一生都在为这个角色排练的人，丘吉尔。丘吉尔。

